{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回はみなさんの気持ちを\nコメントで書いてくださって\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「私たちが生きている今日は\n震災で犠牲になられた皆様が生きたかった今日」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかりと受け止めて、\n大事に生きていく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日...というか、\n昨日はある撮影をしていました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も朝早いので\nがんばるっっっっっ‼\n気合いでがんばるっっっっっ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は私服載せようかしら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいぶ前、Lesson終わりに撮ってもらった^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白のコートかわいいでしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで、いっつも履いてる\nお気に入りのジャーナルスタンダードのデニム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この色落ちとちょとサルエルぽく\nなる感じめっちゃお気になんよ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これおかんのお下がり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーイッシュな天使ちゃん\nみたいな服装です。ねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これこれ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これよ、おNeWになります\nスウェットのロングスカート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外と私服でもいけるんです:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この肩に掛けてるバッグ、\nほぼ毎日使うくらいすきなやつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく見えんと思うけど、\n黒のスニーカー履いてますコンバース"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、じゃんじゃん載せてくでー:D"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、明日...というか今日も頑張りまりか☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、学校お仕事\n頑張りまりかです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はよ寝よ！\nおやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/14/5377066/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}